@startuml
hide footbox
title Register Author in MiteLovers
autoNumber
actor Administrator
participant ":System" as System

Administrator -> System :  I want to register an author in MiteLovers
activate System
System -->> Administrator :  Please provide author information
deactivate System

Administrator -> System :  Here's the information
activate System

System -->> Administrator :  Success
deactivate System
@enduml
